]_{0}^{1} = 2\\pi \\times \\frac{1}{4} = \\frac{\\pi}{2}$"], "scene_steps_count": 6, "math_verdict": "PENDING_REVIEW", "note": "抽取为审核定位材料;精确性/几何/计算逐项判定由审核方给出,不自判"}
{"sample_id": "calc-green-005", "raw_line_sha256": "2e7dae9135a7362934e5d8f8e12b495af3a07615c5985303753c3022ecf2db81", "decimal_literals": [], "fractions": [{"kind": "latex_frac", "value": "\\frac{\\partial Q}{\\partial x}", "source": "solution", "position": 32, "check": "LaTeX 分数,保留符号显示", "verdict": "PENDING_REVIEW"}, {"kind": "latex_frac", "value": "\\frac{\\partial P}{\\partial y}", "source": "solution", "position": 68, "check": "LaTeX 分数,保留符号显示", "verdict": "PENDING_REVIEW"}, {"kind": "latex_frac", "value": "\\frac{\\partial Q}{\\partial x}", "source": "solution", "position": 132, "check": "LaTeX 分数,保留符号显示", "verdict": "PENDING_REVIEW"}, {"kind": "latex_frac", "value": "\\frac{\\partial P}{\\partial y}", "source": "solution", "position": 164, "check": "LaTeX 分数,保留符号显示", "verdict": "PENDING_REVIEW"}], "symbolics": [{"kind": "symbolic", "value": "\\pi", "source": "solution", "position": 278, "check": "符号/根式保留符号,不用近似值", "verdict": "PENDING_REVIEW"}, {"kind": "symbolic", "value": "\\pi", "source": "solution", "position": 298, "check": "符号/根式保留符号,不用近似值", "verdict": "PENDING_REVIEW"}, {"kind": "symbolic", "value": "\\pi", "source": "answer", "position": 2, "check": "符号/根式保留符号,不用近似值", "verdict": "PENDING_REVIEW"}], "solution_steps": ["设 $P(x,y) = -y$，$Q(x,y) = x$", "则 $\\frac{\\partial Q}{\\partial x} = 1$，$\\frac{\\partial P}{\\partial y} = -1$", "由格林公式，原积分 $= \\iint_D \\left( \\frac{\\partial Q}{\\partial x} - \\frac{\\partial P}{\\partial y} \\right) dxdy = \\iint_D (1 - (-1)) dxdy = 2 \\iint_D dxdy$", "因为 $\\iint_D dxdy$ 等于圆盘的面积 $\\pi a^2$，所以原积分 $= 2 \\pi a^2$"], "scene_steps_count": 6, "math_verdict": "PENDING_REVIEW", "note": "抽取为审核定位材料;精确性/几何/计算逐项判定由审核方给出,不自判"}
