W"}, {"kind": "symbolic", "value": "\\pi", "source": "solution", "position": 372, "check": "符号/根式保留符号,不用近似值", "verdict": "PENDING_REVIEW"}, {"kind": "symbolic", "value": "\\pi", "source": "solution", "position": 385, "check": "符号/根式保留符号,不用近似值", "verdict": "PENDING_REVIEW"}, {"kind": "symbolic", "value": "\\pi", "source": "answer", "position": 7, "check": "符号/根式保留符号,不用近似值", "verdict": "PENDING_REVIEW"}, {"kind": "symbolic", "value": "\\pi", "source": "answer", "position": 20, "check": "符号/根式保留符号,不用近似值", "verdict": "PENDING_REVIEW"}], "solution_steps": ["使用圆盘法，体积 $V = \\pi \\int_0^1 (\\arcsin x)^2 dx$", "用分部积分法计算不定积分：令 $u=(\\arcsin x)^2$，$dv=dx$，则 $du=\\frac{2\\arcsin x}{\\sqrt{1-x^2}}dx$，$v=x$，于是 $\\int (\\arcsin x)^2 dx = x(\\arcsin x)^2 - \\int \\frac{2x\\arcsin x}{\\sqrt{1-x^2}} dx = x(\\arcsin x)^2 + 2\\sqrt{1-x^2}\\arcsin x - 2x$", "代入上下限得 $V = \\pi [1 \\cdot (\\frac{\\pi}{2})^2 + 0 - 2] - \\pi [0 + 0 - 0] = \\pi(\\frac{\\pi^2}{4} - 2) = \\frac{\\pi^3}{4} - 2\\pi$"], "scene_steps_count": 6, "math_verdict": "PENDING_REVIEW", "note": "抽取为审核定位材料;精确性/几何/计算逐项判定由审核方给出,不自判"}
